<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Omnipoint started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Omnipoint started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had started coverage of Omnipoint Corp with a near-term accumulate rating and a long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed on Tuesday at 28-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
